  I take the template  'prefs'  icon  from  the  MagicWB  2.0  package  and
  modified  it  into  a HDBackupPrefs'icon reducing the original Hard drive
  icon into a smallest thing, pixel by pixel.

  It's the same for the ABackup's icon.

  For the Install icons, well, I draw the white oval over Xen's  icons  and
  type text inside.

